  "scope": "Selected positive compile requirements in two native builds. Not API coverage or runtime validation. All Framework DBCS encoding maps, byte pairs, splits, aliases and modern file recipes with explicit legacy EOF differences, all Framework single-byte encoding maps, aliases and file recipes, standard generic Predicate2/Predicate3 families, named non-generic delegate families and arrow identities, raw Type property metadata and source-file identity, Predicate/Func identities and conversions, user ICollection bulk insertion, user-record field initialization, methods/interfaces, retained List arrays, native range boxing and RealRange equality semantics are validated separately. Field-initializer recipes are source-derived, not a Pascal compiler oracle. Whole standard-library units remain partial.",
